        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Systems: Rule 90, elementary cellular automata\n- Concepts: exclusive or function\n- People: Stephen Wolfram\n- Products: A New Kind of Science\n- Roles: computer scientist, physicist, businessman\n- Topics: cellular automata\n\nFacts:\n- Rule 90 is an elementary cellular automaton in the mathematical study of cellular automata.\n- Rule 90 is based on the exclusive or function.\n- Rule 90 has been called \"the simplest non-trivial cellular automaton.\"\n- In 2002, Stephen Wolfram released the book A New Kind of Science.\n- A New Kind of Science describes Rule 90 extensively.\n- Stephen Wolfram is a British-American computer scientist, physicist, and businessman.",
